{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "weno3_eno1_D1x_interior",
    "description": "Interior-only hybrid WENO3/ENO1 upwind first derivative d u/dx of NCAR fire_behavior's fire_upwinding = 8 level-set scheme on cartesian_uniform_2d over the block [4, NX-3] x [3, NY-2]: stencils/weno5_eno1_D1x_interior (fire_upwinding = 9) with the WENO branch stencils/weno3_js_upwind_D1x in place of stencils/weno5_js_upwind_D1x, which is the only difference between Calc_tend_ls cases 8 and 9. Per cell the switch is the same: ENO1 minmod (stencils/eno1_minmod_D1x) within bdy_eno1_cells of any wall (stencils/eno1_wall_band) or where |u[i,j]| >= weno_band_cells * dx (outside the band around the front), otherwise the third-order WENO3 derivative with the upwind side picked by signo_x = (grad4 u . U) (d4 u/dx) (stencils/grad4_dot_wind times stencils/central_D1x_4_point). The block is the one the WENO5 sibling uses, so this stencil fits the shared frame rules/weno5_eno1_D1x_extrapolate_frame unchanged: with bdy_eno1_cells >= 3 (fire_behavior's BDY_ENO1 = 10 is a compile-time constant) every cell outside the block is ENO1 in the reference code too, so the shorter WENO3 reach needs no other tiling. FREE NAMES: wind_u, wind_v, bdy_eno1_cells (>= 3), weno_band_cells, and the grid's dx, dy. Both ifelse branches are evaluated on every cell (esm ifelse is not lazy). Order: third in smooth parts of the WENO band, first in the ENO1 regions; exact on a linear field.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_difference",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_2d",
      "op:D",
      "axes:x",
      "order:1",
      "stencil_width:5"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Munoz-Esparza, D., Kosovic, B., Jimenez, P. A., & Coen, J. L. (2018). An accurate fire-spread algorithm in the Weather Research and Forecasting model using the level-set method. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 10(4), 908-926. The hybrid WENO/ENO1 level-set schemes (fire_upwinding = 8, 9) of WRF-Fire / NCAR fire_behavior.",
        "doi": "10.1002/2017MS001108"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Jiang, G.-S., & Shu, C.-W. (1996). Efficient implementation of weighted ENO schemes. Journal of Computational Physics, 126(1), 202-228. The classical smoothness indicators beta_k and nonlinear weights w_k = gamma_k/(beta_k + eps)^2.",
        "doi": "10.1006/jcph.1996.0130"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Harten, A., Engquist, B., Osher, S., & Chakravarthy, S. R. (1987). Uniformly high order accurate essentially non-oscillatory schemes, III. Journal of Computational Physics, 71(2), 231-303. ENO stencil selection by smallest divided difference (first-order form: the minmod limiter).",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(87)90031-3"
      },
      {
        "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580, physics/level_set_mod.F90: Calc_tend_ls (case 8), Select_eno, Select_weno3, Select_4th, Extrapol_var_at_bdys. The transcribed reference implementation."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "eno1_wall_band.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "eno1_minmod_D1x.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "weno3_js_upwind_D1x.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "grad4_dot_wind.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "central_D1x_4_point.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "weno3_eno1_D1x_interior": {
      "params": [
        "u"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "faq",
        "output_idx": [
          "i",
          "j"
        ],
        "args": [
          "u"
        ],
        "ranges": {
          "i": [
            4,
            {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                "NX",
                3
              ]
            }
          ],
          "j": [
            3,
            {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                "NY",
                2
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "expr": {
          "op": "ifelse",
          "args": [
            {
              "op": "or",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "eno1_wall_band",
                  "bindings": {
                    "i": "i",
                    "j": "j"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "op": ">=",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "abs",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": [
                            "u",
                            "i",
                            "j"
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        "weno_band_cells",
                        "dx"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "eno1_minmod_D1x",
              "bindings": {
                "u": "u",
                "i": "i",
                "j": "j"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "weno3_js_upwind_D1x",
              "bindings": {
                "u": "u",
                "i": "i",
                "j": "j",
                "sgn": {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "apply_expression_template",
                      "args": [],
                      "name": "grad4_dot_wind",
                      "bindings": {
                        "u": "u",
                        "i": "i",
                        "j": "j"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "apply_expression_template",
                      "args": [],
                      "name": "central_D1x_4_point",
                      "bindings": {
                        "u": "u",
                        "i": "i",
                        "j": "j"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
